WEBVTT

00:20.640 --> 00:22.520
CHILDREN AND WOMEN'S DISEASES

00:33.560 --> 00:35.840
Everyone dreams

00:35.920 --> 00:39.320
 of having a beautiful life
in this grey world.

00:42.040 --> 00:45.040
However, a coin always has two sides.

00:48.560 --> 00:51.160
It's strange how some people still believe

00:51.240 --> 00:55.320
that humans like us are noble animals
who only have good sides...

01:00.480 --> 01:03.760
and refuse to believe
that we have filthy sides within us.

01:15.880 --> 01:19.240
In order to live in a pretentious society,
you need to have a chic life.

02:46.040 --> 02:50.200
To summarize, our experiment
to share a Buddhism video lesson

02:50.280 --> 02:54.600
encouraging students to meditate
to increase their learning ability

02:54.680 --> 02:58.200
has received positive feedbacks
from both students and parents.

02:58.280 --> 03:01.720
Now, our school is absolutely ready
for new instructional media

03:01.800 --> 03:04.440
which will allow us to get closer
to students more easily.

03:05.240 --> 03:07.400
That's great, Mr. Win.

03:07.960 --> 03:12.080
Other schools are starting to follow
our practices now.

03:13.120 --> 03:15.880
This project is very successful.

03:15.960 --> 03:19.040
It has brought quite a lot
of good reputation to our school.

03:19.120 --> 03:22.240
I have to thank you for this, Mr. Win.

03:22.320 --> 03:24.000
You're welcome.

03:24.080 --> 03:24.920
Thank you.

03:27.760 --> 03:29.440
Does anyone else have anything to say?

03:30.400 --> 03:31.400
Well...

03:31.960 --> 03:36.200
I would like to suggest a project
on how to have safe sex.

03:37.840 --> 03:40.720
And these are the documents
that I have prepared.

03:41.840 --> 03:42.840
Please take a look.

03:45.080 --> 03:47.840
Are you suggesting having
a condom vending machine at school?

03:47.920 --> 03:51.160
Yes. Condoms will protect the students
from sexually transmitted diseases

03:51.240 --> 03:53.160
and prevent unexpected pregnancies.

03:53.240 --> 03:55.920
To be honest, students should be aware
of how to have sex safely.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.560
I don't want to believe my own ears

03:57.640 --> 04:00.720
that this disgusting idea
is coming from a woman.

04:00.800 --> 04:01.880
Excuse me, Jib.

04:01.960 --> 04:04.520
This has nothing to do with my sexuality.

04:04.600 --> 04:06.320
Please focus on the content.

04:06.400 --> 04:09.200
You are encouraging, not preventing it.

04:10.080 --> 04:12.560
But we can't force children at this age
to not think about sex.

04:12.920 --> 04:14.160
They are teenagers.

04:14.800 --> 04:18.519
But it might make students
who had never thought about sex

04:18.600 --> 04:20.880
to think that sex is a normal thing.

04:20.959 --> 04:23.720
Troe, if you would kindly read
all of my documents,

04:23.800 --> 04:25.280
you will see in my proposed project

04:25.360 --> 04:29.240
that there are other campaigns
besides the condom vending machine.

04:31.040 --> 04:32.280
What you've proposed

04:32.840 --> 04:34.880
will only make our students
obsessed with sex.

04:34.960 --> 04:36.360
A teacher with this kind of mindset

04:36.440 --> 04:38.760
is harmful to students and the school.

04:38.840 --> 04:40.240
We should fire her.

04:41.000 --> 04:43.400
Well, I think we should calm down first.

04:43.960 --> 04:46.240
Actually, I understand both of you.

04:46.320 --> 04:47.360
First of all,

04:47.440 --> 04:50.160
we should carefully examine
the pros and cons of this project.

04:50.680 --> 04:53.600
But instead of deciding anything
for this project right now,

04:53.680 --> 04:57.800
how about we create another video lesson?

04:58.360 --> 05:00.720
The video will suggest daily activities

05:00.800 --> 05:03.680
that are beneficial to the children.

05:04.160 --> 05:06.280
We could use yoga.

05:06.640 --> 05:09.120
It will help them concentrate

05:09.600 --> 05:12.480
and also take their minds off sex.

05:13.320 --> 05:15.720
So, the children would be
living their lives mindfully.

05:17.040 --> 05:18.680
I think that is a good idea.

05:18.760 --> 05:22.040
Now that our school has earned the title

05:22.120 --> 05:23.760
of "The Purest School of the Year,"

05:24.320 --> 05:27.840
we should be a good role model

05:27.920 --> 05:29.920
for the other schools in the country.

05:30.760 --> 05:32.000
As for you, Ms. Mali...

05:41.560 --> 05:43.960
Hello, I'm Nanno.

05:45.440 --> 05:47.160
Nice to meet you all.

05:49.440 --> 05:51.720
Nanno, you can sit next to Mei.

05:52.520 --> 05:53.400
Go ahead.

05:53.880 --> 05:55.000
-Okay.
-Okay.

05:56.640 --> 05:59.800
Mr. Win will be your homeroom teacher
for the next two weeks.

06:00.200 --> 06:01.880
Behave well.

06:02.440 --> 06:05.520
Don't give him a headache, understood?

06:08.120 --> 06:10.360
Yes, Mr. Win? What is it?

06:11.400 --> 06:12.640
Can I take a bit of your time?

06:12.720 --> 06:13.840
Sure.

06:14.480 --> 06:16.000
Good morning, everyone.

06:16.080 --> 06:19.000
I'm looking for some volunteers to help me

06:19.080 --> 06:20.800
with the yoga for meditation video.

06:21.360 --> 06:25.600
It would be great to have someone
who knows the basics of yoga.

06:26.240 --> 06:28.240
-Is anyone available?
-I am.

06:28.840 --> 06:29.840
Thank you so much.

06:30.200 --> 06:31.200
Anyone else?

06:36.840 --> 06:38.840
Are you a new student?
Why haven't I seen you before?

06:38.920 --> 06:40.480
Yes. Today is her first day.

06:40.560 --> 06:41.760
Her name is Nanno.

06:41.840 --> 06:43.000
I see. Nanno.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.160
What a cute name.

06:45.240 --> 06:46.280
Thank you, Nanno.

06:46.840 --> 06:48.200
Is there anyone else?

06:50.640 --> 06:51.520
How about Mei?

06:52.040 --> 06:53.520
You do yoga, right?

06:54.240 --> 06:56.840
I saw you helping Mr. Win
with his last video, too.

06:56.920 --> 06:58.280
-Right?
-Yes.

06:59.120 --> 07:01.360
Mei seems to be busy. That's all right.

07:01.440 --> 07:02.600
Two people are enough.

07:02.680 --> 07:04.520
Okay. Two students, then.

07:04.600 --> 07:05.640
-Okay.
-Yes.

07:05.720 --> 07:08.520
Both of you, please meet me
at the audiovisual room after school.

07:08.880 --> 07:11.440
We'll rehearse and start filming
for an hour and a half each day.

07:12.120 --> 07:13.600
-Okay?
-Okay.

07:14.120 --> 07:15.120
Thank you, everyone.

07:15.760 --> 07:17.640
-Thank you, Ms. Mali.
-Thank you.

07:23.920 --> 07:24.800
Hey.

07:25.840 --> 07:27.560
Mr. Win is so cute.

07:27.640 --> 07:30.200
It's such a shame that he is married
and has a kid already.

07:30.760 --> 07:31.760
Really?

07:50.680 --> 07:52.160
Okay. Next position.

08:00.120 --> 08:01.600
Let me fix you up a bit.

08:02.480 --> 08:03.560
You are fine, right?

08:04.200 --> 08:06.240
Let me see. Stand straight first, Nanno.

08:08.840 --> 08:09.920
Well...

08:10.000 --> 08:12.800
I think you need
to bend your back a bit more.

08:12.880 --> 08:13.720
Okay.

08:24.000 --> 08:25.000
This looks difficult.

08:25.720 --> 08:26.960
English is also difficult.

08:27.360 --> 08:29.080
-Everything looks difficult.
-Right.

08:29.160 --> 08:30.240
I haven't...

08:30.320 --> 08:32.840
Your mom made
stir-fried sugar snap peas again.

08:32.919 --> 08:34.480
Whose favorite is that?

08:37.200 --> 08:38.960
How was school today, Vaew?

08:39.600 --> 08:41.880
The teacher told us
to write an essay today.

08:41.960 --> 08:44.159
We had to write it in English, too, Dad.

09:03.920 --> 09:05.200
Mom.

09:07.440 --> 09:09.840
Mom, that's enough.

09:11.920 --> 09:12.840
That's enough, Mom.

09:13.800 --> 09:14.840
That's enough.

09:15.560 --> 09:16.720
Fine. I'm stopping now.

09:16.800 --> 09:19.680
-Why do you like to tease me?
-Why are you embarrassed?

09:19.760 --> 09:22.000
-It's cute.
-Why are you embarrassed, Vaew?

09:22.680 --> 09:24.280
Don't be embarrassed. Your essay is good.

09:36.320 --> 09:37.280
Nanno.

09:37.360 --> 09:39.360
Nanno, we should go.
We shouldn't make Mr. Win wait.

09:40.400 --> 09:41.880
I'm sorry, Ing.

09:41.960 --> 09:44.000
Mr. Win told me to tell you

09:44.080 --> 09:46.680
that today's filming schedule is canceled.

09:48.400 --> 09:49.400
I see.

09:49.680 --> 09:51.320
That's good. I get to go home early then.

09:52.600 --> 09:53.760
I'm leaving, then.

09:53.840 --> 09:55.280
-Okay.
-Bye.

09:55.360 --> 09:56.560
Bye, Mei.

09:59.040 --> 10:00.440
What were you saying, Mei?

10:01.160 --> 10:02.120
I...

10:02.200 --> 10:04.240
No, it's nothing.

10:04.840 --> 10:06.240
I'm leaving now.

10:23.640 --> 10:24.800
Hello, Mr. Win.

10:25.680 --> 10:26.840
Hey, Nanno.

10:28.360 --> 10:29.200
Where's Ing?

10:29.760 --> 10:31.200
Ing is a bit sick.

10:31.680 --> 10:32.600
Really?

10:35.200 --> 10:36.880
Should we cancel our schedule today?

10:37.680 --> 10:39.000
Well, it's okay.

10:39.400 --> 10:41.560
The thing is, we need the video
as soon as possible.

10:42.520 --> 10:44.600
Let's just film you alone, okay?

10:45.160 --> 10:46.000
Yes.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.680
Get ready, then.

10:56.200 --> 10:57.200
You can start now, Nanno.

11:44.800 --> 11:46.040
I think you're tired now.

11:49.760 --> 11:50.880
Do you want to rest first?

11:59.920 --> 12:01.400
Are you sure?

12:04.760 --> 12:05.920
Why wouldn't I be?

12:10.360 --> 12:13.240
You're sure about this,
aren't you, Mr. Win?

12:44.800 --> 12:47.640
You know what you have to do
about us, right?

12:54.920 --> 12:56.240
Meet me tomorrow at the same time.

12:57.600 --> 12:58.480
Okay.

13:28.680 --> 13:29.840
Come in, Mei.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.680
Ms. Mali.

13:36.120 --> 13:37.040
Well...

13:37.600 --> 13:41.200
I need to talk to you about something.

13:41.760 --> 13:43.280
Sure. Have a seat.

13:45.320 --> 13:46.640
What's going on?

13:53.000 --> 13:54.760
You can talk to me about anything.

13:54.840 --> 13:55.920
Don't worry.

14:00.320 --> 14:01.560
Well...

14:03.400 --> 14:04.760
My friend.

14:06.400 --> 14:07.480
She's...

14:08.560 --> 14:09.880
pregnant.

14:15.640 --> 14:19.560
And has she told her parents about it?

14:21.760 --> 14:24.120
No. She hasn't told them yet.

14:26.040 --> 14:26.960
And...

14:27.920 --> 14:29.840
does the father know?

14:34.440 --> 14:36.040
-Okay.
-But...

14:37.760 --> 14:39.080
the father...

14:41.440 --> 14:42.560
He...

14:44.320 --> 14:45.800
wants my friend

14:47.680 --> 14:48.800
to get an abortion.

14:50.000 --> 14:51.000
I see.

14:53.400 --> 14:55.640
Does your friend want to do that?

15:00.200 --> 15:02.840
Actually, there are many solutions
to this problem.

15:03.160 --> 15:05.320
For instance, drop out
and come back to school later.

15:05.400 --> 15:06.520
-Or--
-But my friend

15:06.600 --> 15:08.040
doesn't want to keep the baby either.

15:10.920 --> 15:12.920
Then I kind of understand now.

15:13.880 --> 15:15.880
So what did you want to talk to me about?

15:18.320 --> 15:19.400
Ms. Mali,

15:20.680 --> 15:22.120
do you know where

15:23.200 --> 15:24.240
to...

15:28.760 --> 15:30.760
to get an abortion?

15:36.360 --> 15:37.280
Mei.

15:38.000 --> 15:39.520
If it's really necessary,

15:40.080 --> 15:41.680
I can take you there.

15:45.800 --> 15:49.240
-It's not me.
-Wait, Mei. I...

15:54.760 --> 15:58.040
I know a place that you can go to.

16:01.880 --> 16:03.760
You didn't close the door properly.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.400
But don't worry.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.640
I won't tell anyone.

16:13.600 --> 16:15.120
I can take you there.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.520
Don't cry.

16:30.640 --> 16:31.640
Nanno, Ing.

16:32.120 --> 16:35.040
I need to cancel today's yoga filming.

16:35.360 --> 16:36.200
-Okay.
-Sure.

16:36.280 --> 16:37.280
As for you, Nanno,

16:37.360 --> 16:39.480
meet me at the audiovisual room
after lunch.

16:39.560 --> 16:41.280
I need to retake
some of the shots yesterday.

16:41.360 --> 16:42.360
It won't take a long time.

16:43.160 --> 16:44.000
Okay.

16:44.080 --> 16:45.200
Do I need to go, too?

16:45.280 --> 16:47.480
No. They were Nanno's scenes.

16:48.400 --> 16:49.520
Okay?

16:51.080 --> 16:52.600
Didn't he cancel the filming yesterday?

16:52.960 --> 16:56.440
He changed his mind after you left.
He said we needed to rush it.

16:57.040 --> 17:00.080
Hey, then you did get
to be with him alone, right?

17:00.640 --> 17:02.280
I'm so jealous.

17:03.280 --> 17:07.119
Can you pretend to be sick
so I can be alone with him next time?

17:20.240 --> 17:22.200
Are you not afraid
that someone will come in?

17:23.440 --> 17:24.680
Don't worry.

17:25.319 --> 17:27.000
This is my private space.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.480
No.

17:28.920 --> 17:30.320
It's our private space.

17:30.920 --> 17:33.200
No one can come in here
without my permission.

17:42.200 --> 17:43.200
Right.

17:44.640 --> 17:46.120
I have something to show you.

18:02.600 --> 18:04.000
You look beautiful on camera.

18:12.320 --> 18:13.320
Mr. Win.

18:13.800 --> 18:15.480
You already have a family.

18:18.200 --> 18:19.680
Now isn't the time to talk about this.

18:20.120 --> 18:21.320
We don't have much time.

18:22.720 --> 18:24.240
But you are aware

18:25.600 --> 18:27.120
that what we are doing is wrong, right?

18:30.640 --> 18:33.160
Are you not afraid
of the consequences of your actions?

18:37.360 --> 18:39.000
The consequences of my actions?

18:41.120 --> 18:43.120
Do you want to know
what the consequences are?

18:46.920 --> 18:48.520
If these videos get released,

18:49.800 --> 18:51.400
what do you think will happen to you?

18:53.600 --> 18:55.480
You don't want me to release them, right?

19:46.600 --> 19:47.600
Wan.

19:49.360 --> 19:52.160
I'm so hungry. What did you cook today?

19:57.920 --> 19:59.600
What's wrong, Wan?

20:06.400 --> 20:08.600
Where did you find this?

20:09.760 --> 20:10.720
Where?

20:18.040 --> 20:19.160
It wasn't me.

20:19.240 --> 20:21.440
It was a girl named Nanno who returned it.

20:22.520 --> 20:24.040
She's a nice girl.

20:24.120 --> 20:25.680
You forgot your cell phone

20:26.120 --> 20:29.440
and she asked Mr. Troe for our address
then she came here right away.

20:31.880 --> 20:34.120
That girl went home, right?

20:34.200 --> 20:36.040
Vaew took her upstairs.

20:36.520 --> 20:40.160
They got along so well
so I invited her to stay for dinner.

20:43.160 --> 20:45.680
She might need to go home early, Wan.

20:46.760 --> 20:48.760
No. I already asked her.

20:54.240 --> 20:55.320
Thank you.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.280
Thank you.

21:12.720 --> 21:14.920
You need to eat a lot

21:15.280 --> 21:18.080
so you become fatter, Nanno.
You are so thin right now.

21:18.160 --> 21:19.000
Really?

21:19.720 --> 21:21.920
But Mr. Win said I had a good body though.

21:23.280 --> 21:25.680
That's why he asked me
to film the yoga video with him.

21:26.360 --> 21:28.680
So you're the one helping him
with his video.

21:29.960 --> 21:32.960
You have the perfect body for yoga.

21:34.600 --> 21:35.760
Thank you.

21:36.160 --> 21:38.280
You should join us sometime.

21:38.360 --> 21:40.000
It would be fun with the three of us.

21:44.440 --> 21:46.640
Is she good at yoga, Dad?

21:47.440 --> 21:49.880
-Well, I--
-I'm not good at it.

21:50.440 --> 21:51.720
Mr. Win is the good one.

21:52.120 --> 21:54.320
He taught me so many difficult positions.

21:54.800 --> 21:56.360
It must be tiring. Right, Mr. Win?

21:58.560 --> 22:02.840
Not really. Actually, I think
that you are already quite skilled.

22:03.440 --> 22:05.400
Don't be humble, Nanno.

22:06.320 --> 22:08.440
Nanno is very smart, Mom.

22:08.520 --> 22:11.560
She helped me
with a really hard homework just now.

22:11.840 --> 22:14.080
What subject did she help you with?

22:14.360 --> 22:15.800
It was the essay about my role model.

22:16.640 --> 22:18.360
Thank you so much, Nanno.

22:18.960 --> 22:20.200
It's not a problem at all.

22:20.560 --> 22:22.480
What Vaew wrote was already good.

22:22.840 --> 22:25.080
I almost cried when I was reading it.

22:25.960 --> 22:29.080
Mr. Win is such an amazing father.

22:29.160 --> 22:31.320
Don't tease me, Nanno.

22:31.720 --> 22:33.720
I'm not teasing you.

22:33.800 --> 22:35.680
Look at my tear stain
if you don't believe me.

22:37.680 --> 22:39.240
How about this?

22:39.320 --> 22:42.760
Can you tutor Vaew whenever you are free?

22:43.200 --> 22:46.440
Win and I aren't available lately.

22:46.520 --> 22:47.840
We always come home late.

22:50.360 --> 22:54.760
Wan, let's not bother Nanno.

22:54.840 --> 22:56.640
She has her own homework to do.

22:56.720 --> 22:58.880
But I'm not making her come every day.

22:59.280 --> 23:02.040
She can come only when she is free.

23:02.120 --> 23:03.480
It's not a big deal, Win.

23:04.120 --> 23:06.520
Wan, you know how hard
high school students study.

23:08.240 --> 23:09.400
Right, Nanno?

23:09.480 --> 23:10.560
No, it's fine.

23:11.120 --> 23:12.720
By tutoring Vaew,

23:12.800 --> 23:15.320
I can get a chance to review
the things that I've learned.

23:15.400 --> 23:16.560
It's a great opportunity.

23:17.840 --> 23:21.720
How about we start tomorrow
since I have to work overtime?

23:21.800 --> 23:22.720
I'll be happy to.

23:22.800 --> 23:25.040
Please call me later
so we can arrange the schedule.

23:25.120 --> 23:28.080
Yes! You are so nice, Nanno.

23:30.480 --> 23:33.880
Actually, I think you can invite
your friends, too, Vaew.

23:34.520 --> 23:36.240
I won't charge extra.

23:36.320 --> 23:38.480
-Really?
-Of course.

23:54.960 --> 23:56.080
Mr. Win.

23:56.400 --> 23:58.200
You already have a family.

23:58.760 --> 24:00.480
Now isn't the time to talk about this.

24:00.560 --> 24:01.680
We don't have much time.

24:02.440 --> 24:04.240
But you are aware

24:04.320 --> 24:05.840
that what we are doing is wrong, right?

24:06.160 --> 24:08.440
Are you not afraid
of the consequences of your actions?

24:09.040 --> 24:10.680
If these videos get released,

24:11.120 --> 24:12.560
what do you think will happen to you?

24:13.640 --> 24:15.440
You don't want me to release them, right?

24:21.040 --> 24:24.600
YOU KNOW WHAT YOU HAVE TO DO
ABOUT US, RIGHT?

24:44.120 --> 24:46.360
Ing, are Nanno and Mei
not coming to school today?

24:46.440 --> 24:49.040
They're both sick today.

24:51.160 --> 24:52.240
Mr. Win.

24:52.320 --> 24:53.760
Do we meet at the same time today?

24:53.840 --> 24:54.720
We can't film today.

24:56.160 --> 24:59.440
Aren't you in a rush, Mr. Win?
You can film me alone today.

25:04.560 --> 25:05.920
Shit.

25:07.040 --> 25:08.440
Hello, Mr. Win.

25:09.640 --> 25:10.880
What do you think are you doing?

25:11.240 --> 25:12.720
What am I doing?

25:13.560 --> 25:14.880
Don't act innocent.

25:15.360 --> 25:16.680
You stole my phone.

25:18.040 --> 25:20.000
Did you think I kept those videos
on my phone?

25:21.600 --> 25:22.640
It's not that easy.

25:23.120 --> 25:24.520
I didn't steal your phone.

25:24.920 --> 25:26.520
You forgot it yourself.

25:27.200 --> 25:29.240
Otherwise, I wouldn't have returned it.

25:30.440 --> 25:32.160
What the hell are you doing?

25:32.240 --> 25:35.040
Not only did you go to my house,
but you also sent me the audio file.

25:37.440 --> 25:40.840
You seem to like recording things.
So I sent you one.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.960
I thought you would be happy.

25:44.200 --> 25:45.240
Don't you know

25:46.400 --> 25:47.840
that I have your videos?

25:49.000 --> 25:50.320
And once I release those videos,

25:51.040 --> 25:52.480
what do you think will happen to you?

25:53.000 --> 25:54.400
I understand.

25:58.440 --> 26:00.520
You have to completely stop
messing with my family.

26:01.760 --> 26:02.840
Do you understand?

26:02.920 --> 26:04.160
I understand.

26:06.640 --> 26:08.640
And I order you to meet me
at the audiovisual room

26:10.240 --> 26:12.240
at the same time this evening.

26:12.760 --> 26:13.760
Do you understand?

26:14.400 --> 26:16.080
I understand.

26:18.640 --> 26:20.280
We understand each other, then.

26:28.960 --> 26:30.000
Nanno.

26:30.840 --> 26:33.520
You have to be really careful
with someone like that.

26:34.720 --> 26:36.520
Don't worry about me, Mei.

26:45.120 --> 26:46.920
FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM

26:52.320 --> 26:53.320
Mei.

26:55.320 --> 26:57.200
You should decide for yourself.

27:30.040 --> 27:31.360
Are you still watching the video?

27:32.040 --> 27:33.200
This view is more beautiful.

27:34.160 --> 27:35.280
Oh, please.

27:38.160 --> 27:40.720
I'm glad that I got to come
to your house today.

27:45.400 --> 27:47.200
Should we study at my house next time?

27:47.800 --> 27:50.600
And we can tell Nanno
to come half an hour late.

27:52.480 --> 27:53.480
No.

27:55.080 --> 27:56.320
Why not?

27:57.040 --> 27:58.760
My mom really wants to meet you.

27:59.880 --> 28:00.800
No.

28:03.600 --> 28:06.880
By the way, what time are your parents
coming home today?

28:07.800 --> 28:08.800
Well...

28:09.400 --> 28:10.520
Late.

28:11.080 --> 28:12.080
Why?

28:28.400 --> 28:29.400
Nanno.

28:30.280 --> 28:32.200
The front door is locked.

28:34.240 --> 28:35.320
I see.

28:37.480 --> 28:38.520
Is this your boyfriend?

28:38.600 --> 28:40.320
-Yes.
-No.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.480
He's really not my boyfriend.

28:43.960 --> 28:45.240
All right, I believe you.

28:46.520 --> 28:47.800
Well...

28:49.320 --> 28:52.320
Do you guys want to go
somewhere outside for the tutorial?

29:13.320 --> 29:14.720
MR. WIN
SLIDE TO ANSWER

29:17.040 --> 29:18.200
Is there something wrong?

29:19.280 --> 29:21.720
I think I need to run an errand outside.

29:22.000 --> 29:22.880
What?

29:23.680 --> 29:26.400
Then, do you want me to go with you?

29:26.480 --> 29:27.560
No, it's fine.

29:28.120 --> 29:29.640
You guys can wait here.

29:31.280 --> 29:32.280
Are you sure?

29:32.840 --> 29:33.960
Of course.

29:36.400 --> 29:37.640
Will it take you a long time?

29:41.520 --> 29:42.680
Probably not.

29:43.600 --> 29:46.400
I should be done in about an hour.

29:50.920 --> 29:52.920
Vaew, can I borrow your phone?

29:56.680 --> 29:57.600
Here you go.

29:58.240 --> 30:00.520
Thank you. Make yourself at home.

30:18.520 --> 30:19.760
What should we do?

30:20.640 --> 30:21.600
I don't know.

30:26.240 --> 30:27.120
What?

30:52.840 --> 30:54.320
Hello, Mr. Win.

30:54.800 --> 30:56.440
You are quite hotheaded.

30:56.520 --> 30:58.040
What do you think are you doing?

30:58.400 --> 30:59.720
Don't you dare mess with me.

31:00.080 --> 31:01.640
Do you think I won't release the videos?

31:03.320 --> 31:04.400
It's not that.

31:04.960 --> 31:06.960
I had an errand to run,

31:07.440 --> 31:08.880
but I'm almost there.

31:10.720 --> 31:12.280
I'll give you 15 minutes.

31:12.560 --> 31:14.680
If you are not here by then,
I will release your videos.

31:31.640 --> 31:32.640
Come on.

31:33.400 --> 31:34.920
What are you talking about?

31:37.200 --> 31:38.480
What are you doing?

31:39.440 --> 31:40.280
Vaew.

31:40.600 --> 31:41.720
If you love me,

31:42.120 --> 31:43.200
can I have it?

31:43.840 --> 31:44.920
Have what?

32:07.240 --> 32:08.320
What is it, Nanno?

32:09.560 --> 32:13.000
Mr. Win, the school gate is closed.

32:13.520 --> 32:15.840
Can you come and get me downstairs?

32:19.400 --> 32:20.560
Fine.

33:12.640 --> 33:13.960
Hello, Mr. Win.

33:14.840 --> 33:16.640
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

33:17.200 --> 33:18.040
What are you doing?

33:19.440 --> 33:20.520
Why are you up there?

33:23.440 --> 33:27.440
There are so many interesting folders
in this room's computers.

33:28.440 --> 33:30.200
Can I take a look at them?

33:31.360 --> 33:32.880
Come down here if you want to see them.

33:33.520 --> 33:34.640
I'll show you.

33:35.200 --> 33:36.840
I can't go down.

33:37.560 --> 33:39.120
You are too dangerous.

33:40.560 --> 33:42.080
Why are you hiding up there?

33:42.680 --> 33:44.880
You can't access it without the password.

33:45.840 --> 33:47.080
Come down and let's talk it out.

33:52.800 --> 33:54.440
Even though I can't access it,

33:55.520 --> 33:57.720
I still have something good to show you.

33:58.120 --> 34:00.160
I'm sure you will definitely like it.

34:10.360 --> 34:11.280
Vaew.

34:11.760 --> 34:12.960
What did you do to my daughter?

34:13.880 --> 34:15.560
What did I do?

34:16.360 --> 34:17.560
What did you do?

34:17.719 --> 34:19.760
I didn't do anything, Mr. Win.

34:20.840 --> 34:22.400
To be honest,

34:22.480 --> 34:24.480
Vaew seems very happy.

34:24.920 --> 34:26.080
Do you have a condom?

34:27.840 --> 34:29.000
No.

34:30.000 --> 34:31.360
Shall we turn up the volume?

34:31.440 --> 34:32.440
Let me have it.

34:33.800 --> 34:35.000
I'll kill you.

34:42.239 --> 34:44.880
-Hey.
-Hello, Dad.

34:45.920 --> 34:48.440
I'm in the middle of a tutorial.

34:48.520 --> 34:50.840
But I'm almost done.

34:52.920 --> 34:57.640
Num, are you sure? We don't have a condom.

34:57.720 --> 34:59.440
What if something happens?

35:00.320 --> 35:02.400
Nanno, come down right now!

35:02.480 --> 35:03.800
Open the door for me now!

35:04.920 --> 35:06.720
Mr. Win.

35:08.080 --> 35:09.800
If something happens to me,

35:10.360 --> 35:14.160
you will never know
where Vaew is right now.

35:15.160 --> 35:16.280
Where is my daughter?

35:19.040 --> 35:20.320
I said where is my daughter?

35:22.240 --> 35:24.680
I think we should do a live broadcast.

35:24.760 --> 35:26.240
We will probably get so many likes.

35:26.920 --> 35:29.040
Nanno, I'm begging you.
Where is my daughter?

35:30.400 --> 35:32.600
You need to try a bit harder than this.

35:32.880 --> 35:34.040
Something like...

35:34.440 --> 35:36.600
going down on your knees and beg.

35:45.480 --> 35:47.000
Where is my daughter?

35:49.240 --> 35:50.360
Fine.

35:51.320 --> 35:53.360
Since you've tried so hard, I'll tell you.

35:54.800 --> 35:56.760
But I still want to know the password.

36:01.040 --> 36:02.720
You should hurry.

36:02.800 --> 36:05.360
Vaew is waiting for her daddy.

36:05.440 --> 36:07.880
No, actually, it's her role model daddy.

36:07.960 --> 36:10.360
And if her role model daddy
doesn't decide soon,

36:10.920 --> 36:12.560
it might be too late.

36:12.840 --> 36:14.640
Vaew would already be done by then.

37:07.280 --> 37:08.360
Who's that?

37:09.400 --> 37:10.320
Just ignore it.

37:10.400 --> 37:11.480
Is it another girl?

37:11.800 --> 37:13.880
-Let me see.
-I said it's nothing.

37:13.960 --> 37:15.600
-What is it?
-It's nothing.

37:39.880 --> 37:43.960
DO YOU WANT TO SEE SOMETHING FUN, WAN?

37:54.360 --> 37:55.520
-Dad.
-You little bastard.

37:55.880 --> 37:57.320
-What?
-What did you do to her?

37:57.400 --> 37:58.880
Dad, stop right now!

37:58.960 --> 37:59.800
Dad.

38:00.400 --> 38:01.360
Dad!

38:01.440 --> 38:05.240
COME TO THIS LOCATION
IF YOU WANT TO SEE MORE.

38:06.320 --> 38:07.480
LOCATION

38:07.560 --> 38:08.560
SHARE LOCATION

38:13.800 --> 38:16.400
Dad! I said stop!

38:16.480 --> 38:17.440
Come here.

38:19.320 --> 38:20.760
How could you be so horrible?

38:24.760 --> 38:26.280
If I'm horrible,

38:29.840 --> 38:31.480
then you are pretty much the same.

38:40.840 --> 38:42.760
Vaew.

38:43.520 --> 38:44.400
Vaew.

38:44.840 --> 38:45.680
Stop now, Vaew.

38:45.760 --> 38:47.200
-I told you to stop.
-Let go!

38:47.280 --> 38:49.120
Let go. Let go of me right now!

38:59.840 --> 39:01.840
I shouldn't have been born
as your daughter.

39:13.000 --> 39:14.040
Vaew.

39:18.360 --> 39:19.600
Vaew.

39:20.320 --> 39:21.480
Please be okay.

39:22.080 --> 39:23.360
You can't die.

39:24.280 --> 39:25.200
Vaew.

39:26.680 --> 39:27.800
Vaew.

39:27.880 --> 39:29.000
Don't die, Vaew!

39:29.600 --> 39:30.600
Vaew!

39:31.040 --> 39:32.920
I said don't die!

39:33.960 --> 39:35.200
Are you sure?

39:36.480 --> 39:37.880
Why wouldn't I be?

39:56.360 --> 39:59.440
You're sure about this,
aren't you, Mr. Win?

40:30.040 --> 40:31.280
Ms. Mali.

40:32.480 --> 40:34.240
Thank you so much

40:35.080 --> 40:37.080
for all the care you have given me.

40:38.200 --> 40:43.200
Now, I have decided to quit school.

40:44.000 --> 40:46.280
I hope to see you again.

40:47.440 --> 40:50.760
As for the attached photos and videos,

40:52.320 --> 40:54.480
you can do whatever you like with them.

40:55.960 --> 40:57.560
I miss you, Ms. Mali.

40:57.640 --> 40:59.240
-You can't enter.
-Do not take any photos.

40:59.320 --> 41:00.360
-I'm going in.
-You can't.

41:00.960 --> 41:02.000
Do not take photos.

41:02.080 --> 41:03.000
Watch out!

41:03.080 --> 41:04.280
-Please let me in.
-You can't.

41:04.360 --> 41:06.440
-Mister, is this you?
-You can't enter.

41:06.520 --> 41:08.200
-Mister...
-I just want an interview.

41:08.280 --> 41:10.040
You can't enter.
Please don't take any photos.

41:10.120 --> 41:11.840
-Do you know anything about this?
-No.

41:11.920 --> 41:13.960
Get out of the way.

41:45.160 --> 41:46.240
Nanno!

41:55.640 --> 41:56.960
I'm going to kill you!

42:06.800 --> 42:08.800
Subtitle translation by
Pet-chompoo Sa-ngarmangkang
